            <ArticleTitle>Resistance and tolerance of myocardium in ischemia: experimental results.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>218-27</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The resistance of the normal myocardium to ischemia can be determined by the metabolic and electric investigations, and particularly by the determination of the intra-myocardial potentials. The aspect of V.F. and the metabolic changes allow aetiologic deductions on the V.F. and are helpful for the treatment.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
